  "wuduDuaAfterTranslit": "Ash-hadu an lā ilāha illallāh, waḥdahu lā sharīka lah, wa ash-hadu anna Muḥammadan ʿabduhu wa rasūluh. Allāhumma ijʿalnī min al-tawwābīn, wajʿalnī min al-mutaṭahhirīn.",
